---
// import FlowerOpaque from "@images/FlowerOpaque.svg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Flower from "@images/FlowerPicture.png";
import Victoria from "@images/VictoriaFull.webp";
---

<div
  class="grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 place-items-center py-10 sm:ml-10 sm:grid-cols-2 md:ml-15 md:overflow-clip lg:ml-25"
>
  <div
    class="col-1 row-1 mb-5 grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 place-items-center sm:col-2"
  >
    <div
      class="relative -z-10 col-1 row-1 -mt-90 -ml-70 w-9/12 md:-mt-110 md:-ml-30 lg:mr-30 lg:mb-10 lg:w-1/2 xl:mr-90 xl:mb-60 xl:w-8/12"
    >
      <Image src={Flower} alt="flower" class="absolute" />
    </div>
    <div class="z-10 col-1 row-1">
      <Image
        src={Victoria}
        class="m-auto size-5/8 rounded-full border-3 border-orange-400 shadow-sm sm:size-3/4 md:size-8/12"
        loading="eager"
        alt="Victoria Richards"
      />
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative z-0 col-1 row-1 hidden w-9/12 sm:block md:-mr-50 md:-mb-50 lg:mt-15 lg:ml-20 lg:w-1/2 xl:hidden"
    >
      <Image src={Flower} alt="flower" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class="col-1 row-2 flex flex-col place-items-center gap-5 px-5 sm:row-1 sm:place-items-start sm:p-0 md:gap-15"
  >
    <h2
      class="font-serif-display my-auto text-center text-2xl sm:text-left md:text-3xl xl:text-4xl"
    >
      Hi, I am<br />Victoria Richards!
    </h2>

    <p
      class="font-noto my-auto px-3 text-center sm:max-w-lg sm:px-0 sm:text-left sm:text-lg lg:text-xl"
    >
      Everyone’s different, and I think therapy should reflect that. I work with
      people of all ages and backgrounds, and I show up as my real, authentic
      self in every session. When that connection clicks, the work we do
      together often leads to deep growth and meaningful change.
    </p>
    <div
      class="my-auto flex h-10 w-30 min-w-auto rounded-xl bg-red-400 shadow-sm hover:bg-red-500 hover:shadow-xs"
    >
      <a class="font-noto m-auto text-white" href="#contact-form">Contact Me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
